Auto applying a pick-axe could be hazardous to
your health::

1. digging takes time: 1 block 10 units of time
        can you imagine if you did a <shift> dir into
        a wall? You'd dig until you hit a room or hit
        the end of the screen.

2. All that digging would waste food energy.
3. Wandering monsters could get you while you're busy,
        though that has been changed in 3.1 in which
        as soon as you even notice monster movement
        you stop digging.

Something similar happened to me when I was an Umber
Hulk....you can't run for beans or you'll ruin the whole
screen.

